    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Farhat Abbas, Dean, Medical College and The Hussein Cumber Professor, Department of Surgery, Aga Khan University, was conferred the Sitara-i-Imtiaz - the third highest civilian award by the Government of Pakistan - for his achievements in the field of medicine by President Mamnoon Hussain.",
